# Know One's Onions (windurst 40): the offer's operands. Level 5. Truth, Justice, and the Onion Way! accepted (not
# completed): section 1's quest operand false alone: not available; that quest's own 371. Completed by GM: available;
# this quest's char-var mustZone set by GM (nothing else sets it): Kohlo-Lakolo's 379; a warp out and back clears it:
# 391, begun.
lists PortWindurst/Kohlo-Lakolo/onTrigger
char zone=PortWindurst pos=-27.5,-8.0,189.6 lvl=5 nation=2
quest Windurst.TruthJusticeAndTheOnionWay accepted
login
trigger Kohlo-Lakolo                           # the first quest not completed: not available; its 371
finish
quest Windurst.TruthJusticeAndTheOnionWay completed   # GM
charvar Quest[2][40]mustZone 240               # GM
trigger Kohlo-Lakolo                           # available; the mustZone: 379
finish
warp -24.5,-14.498,262.994 WindurstWalls
warp -27.5,-8.0,189.6 PortWindurst             # the mustZone cleared
trigger Kohlo-Lakolo                           # 391
finish                                         # Prog 1; begun
